<title>ARMENIA: SOCCER-ARARAT YEREVAN WIN ARMENIAN CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARARAT YEREVAN WIN ARMENIAN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>YEREVAN 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the Armenian Cup final on Wednesday:</p>
<p> Ararat Yerevan     1    Punic Yerevan    0</p>
<p>Scorer:  Sedrak Babayan 6</p>
